---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
const lang = 'en';
const t = (await import('../../translations/en.json')).default;
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={t.nav.samples} description="Important texts translated into Simpli.">
  <h1>{t.nav.samples}</h1>
  <p>Sample texts in Simpli.</p>
  <h2>Universal Declaration of Human Rights (Article 1)</h2>
  <div class="simpli-block">ol hyuman pipol born fri and ikwal.
dey hav digniti and rait.
    dey hav rizon and konshens and shud akt wit gud spirit tu oder pipol.</div>
  <h2>Short dialogue</h2>
  <div class="simpli-block">wer yu from ?
mi from frans.

yu liv here ?
yes, mi liv here now.

wat yu du ?
mi wok wit komputer and langwij.</div>

  <h2>Why Simpli? (longer text)</h2>
  <div class="simpli-block">Simpli bi a simpil langwij. Yu kan lern it fast. It hav no hard gramar. Word kam from inglish bat de speling bi izi. Evri sound hav wan leta. Yu rid wat yu sii. Meni pipol in de wold no som inglish. For dey Simpli bi a briy. Dey kan yuse it tu tok tu oder. Dey kan yuse it for wok or trawel. Wi want de wold tu hav wan simpil langwij. Simpli kan bi dat langwij.</div>
  <p class="sample-note"><em>English:</em> Simpli is a simple language. You can learn it fast. It has no hard grammar. Words come from English but the spelling is easy. Every sound has one letter. You read what you see. Many people in the world know some English. For them Simpli is a bridge. They can use it to talk to others. They can use it for work or travel. We want the world to have one simple language. Simpli can be that language.</p>
</Layout>
